{"hierarchy":{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","paths":[]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)"]}],"sections":[{"backgroundImage":"ic_unified_ds.png","image":"ic_unified_ds.png","action":{"type":"reference","overridingTitle":"Get started","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}],"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-libraries"},"kind":"hero","title":"Swift Package Discovery Tutorial","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Discovering a new framework can be exciting and scary. Learn how you can embed and use OUDS Swift Package."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"With this tutorial you will learn fundamental concepts of Orange Unified Design System and discover the layers of this framework."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Theme, components, tokens… everything will be introduced!"}]}]},{"name":null,"image":null,"kind":"volume","chapters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In this chapter you will learn how to import the OUDS iOS Swift Package and which libraries it provides","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"you should choose for your needs.","type":"text"}]}],"image":"ic_unified_ds.png","tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-libraries"],"name":"Import of the Swift Package and choose its libraries"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In this chapter you will see how to instanciate a theme and inject it inside your app","type":"text"}]}],"image":"ic_theme_intro.png","tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme"],"name":"Preparation of the theme"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In this chapter you will see how you can use your first components provided by OUDS Swift Package","type":"text"}]}],"image":"ic_component_intro.png","tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components"],"name":"Use of first components provided by OUDS"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In this chapter you will use original components of OUDS and richer ones","type":"text"}]}],"image":"ic_component_intro.png","tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components"],"name":"Richer and more original components of OUDS"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS is not only about components and themes. It provides view modifiers, typographies and tokens which can be used. You will learn how.","type":"text"}]}],"image":"ic_design_token_intro.png","tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things"],"name":"Typography, view modifiers and tokens"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can have questions and issues, and there are resources online. Let’s see that together.","type":"text"}]}],"image":"ic_unified_ds.png","tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further"],"name":"Go further with more ressources"}],"content":[]}],"kind":"overview","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","title":"Swift Package Discovery Tutorial","category":"Orange Unified Design System","estimatedTime":"2hr 5min","role":"overview"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)"},"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Components can be similar to iOS native components, or can also be original and strongly related to Orange Unified Design System needs."}],"title":"Add more OUDS components","type":"topic","estimatedTime":"30min","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","kind":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","role":"project"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The theme is exposed as one object which will be injected inside your SwiftUI view."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The theme provides all tokens which defines in the end the rendering of everything."}],"title":"Instanciate and inject a theme","type":"topic","estimatedTime":"15min","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme","kind":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme","role":"project"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Even if components increase the identity of your apps, it is not enough. Typography, fonts and tokens are here to improve that."}],"title":"Styling things","type":"topic","estimatedTime":"30min","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things","kind":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things","role":"project"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-libraries":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several libraries for your needs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These libraries help to split products and make users able to select only what they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms."}],"title":"Swift Package integration","type":"topic","estimatedTime":"10min","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-libraries","kind":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-libraries","role":"project"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources."}],"title":"Going further with more resources","type":"topic","estimatedTime":"10min","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further","kind":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further","role":"project"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS provides components ready to be used, specified in Figma assets and preventing users to handle tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They are rendered thanks to the theme in use."}],"title":"Use your first OUDS components","type":"topic","estimatedTime":"30min","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components","kind":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components","role":"project"},"ic_theme_intro.png":{"identifier":"ic_theme_intro.png","type":"image","alt":"OUDS themes logo","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/ic_theme_intro.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"ic_design_token_intro.png":{"identifier":"ic_design_token_intro.png